              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. SAML vs OIDC",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "SAML 2.0",
                "OIDC"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Payload",
                  "XML assertion, XML-DSig signed",
                  "JSON / JWT"
                ],
                [
                  "Transport",
                  "POSTed via browser to SP's ACS URL",
                  "HTTPS, on OAuth 2.0"
                ],
                [
                  "Roles",
                  "IdP and SP",
                  "Auth server and client"
                ],
                [
                  "Fits",
                  "Enterprise, legacy apps",
                  "SPAs, mobile, APIs"
                ],
                [
                  "Effort",
                  "Heavier",
                  "Easier; ==better default== for new apps"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 4
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Who Starts the Login",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "App",
                    "sub": "SP-initiated start",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Redirect",
                    "sub": "to IdP",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Login",
                    "sub": "at IdP",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Back to app",
                    "sub": "assertion or code",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{red:IdP-initiated} starts at the IdP portal",
                "More exposed to ==CSRF== and **replay**"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes That Cause Breaches",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Skipping the `state` check allows ==CSRF login== attacks",
                "Loose `redirect_uri` matching: open redirects leak codes and tokens",
                "Access token as proof of login, or no `aud` and `iss` check",
                "Tokens in `localStorage`, long-lived access tokens, over-broad scopes",
                "`client_secret` shipped in a SPA or mobile app"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Exact URIs",
              "text": "Register ==exact== `redirect_uri` values. Prove login with the **ID token**; the access token only calls the API."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
